                                "sense_id": "70098664-79d3-3877-8780-684279909267",
                                "text": "However, many thinkers (Protestant and Catholic) have used historical-critical methods to relativize New Testament materials on sex and gender to their original settings, rather quickly substituting for \"obsolete\" moral prohibitions a modern, liberal set of values[…]"
                            }
